---
description: Enforce feedback, analytics, and prompt evolution loop integrity
globs: ["**"]
alwaysApply: true
ruleType: Always
---

* All core user interactions must trigger structured data capture into `PromptLogs`, `FeedbackLogs`, `SessionAnalytics`, or `ReferralTriggers` as defined in `self-awareness.json`.  
* Do not remove or bypass feedback requests unless replaced with an enriched feedback mechanism.  
* Edits to prompt scaffolds or UX outputs must be evaluated for impact on analytics capture fidelity.  
* Ensure prompt version deltas are logged when core outputs change.  
* If feedback shows revise frequency over 1.5x baseline, trigger Prompt Intelligence Loop or lifecycle optimization.  

